      "title": {
        "en": "Xal'atath's Feet - TechRaptor Interview on Midnight: Eclipse",
        "es": "Xal'atath's Feet - TechRaptor Interview on Midnight: Eclipse"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "In an interview with TechRaptor, Blizzard discussed Xal'atath's feet and the new player experience.Continue reading »...",
        "es": "In an interview with TechRaptor, Blizzard discussed Xal'atath's feet and the new player experience.Continue reading »..."
      },
      "content": {
        "en": "<div class=\"space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/30 shadow-lg max-h-[340px] bg-black/50 mb-3\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55349-xalataths-feet-techraptor-interview-on-midnight-eclipse.jpg\" alt=\"Xal'atath's Feet - TechRaptor Interview on Midnight: Eclipse\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[340px] rounded-xl hover:scale-[1.01] transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><div class=\"bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-500/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-300 font-bold\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-newspaper mr-1.5\"></i> Wowhead Official Article</span><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news=382971/xalataths-feet-techraptor-interview-on-midnight-eclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 hover:text-white underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\">View on Wowhead <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]\"></i></a></div><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3\">In an interview with TechRaptor, Blizzard discussed Xal'atath's feet and the new player experience.<p>TechRaptor Interview</p>\n<p>TechRaptor interviewed:</p>\n<p>Paul Kubit (Associate Game Director)</p>\n<p>Kim Flack (Senior Game Designer)</p>\n<p>We've summarized the interview below, but you can see the original pieces on TechRaptor.</p>\n<p>Interview Summary</p>\n<p>Xal'atath</p>\n<p>Players noticed that Xal'atath got into a heavily guarded place easily. This wasn't an \"oversight on the Titans,\" and there are missing pieces of the story.</p>\n<p>The body that Xal'atath possesses loves to float, and that's why you typically get an angle of her feet. In addition, based on the way the community and cinematic team react to a shot, they might add another shot. </p>\n<p>They want to make sure to pay attention to the community.</p>\n<p>She has brought a much darker tone to WoW, as Midnight was always going to be the dark middle chapter of the Worldsoul Saga.</p>\n<p>Paladins</p>\n<p>They decided to add three new races to become Paladins in Patch 12.2, as it ties into the story.</p>\n<p>The Light and Void are two sides of the same coin.</p>\n<p>There will be quests that give some background on how the races could become Paladins.</p>\n<p>New Player Experience</p>\n<p>There is too much story across too many expansions to teach to a new player.</p>\n<p>The approach for Midnight is that you play through Exile's Reach and then Dragonflight.</p>\n<p>Dragonflight gives you everything you need in WoW and explains what you need to do. Older expansions don't have that.</p>\n<p>They plan to improve the War Within recap.<br></p>\n</div></div>",
        "es": "<div class=\"space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/30 shadow-lg max-h-[340px] bg-black/50 mb-3\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55349-xalataths-feet-techraptor-interview-on-midnight-eclipse.jpg\" alt=\"Xal'atath's Feet - TechRaptor Interview on Midnight: Eclipse\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[340px] rounded-xl hover:scale-[1.01] transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><div class=\"bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-500/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-300 font-bold\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-newspaper mr-1.5\"></i> Artículo Oficial de Wowhead</span><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news=382971/xalataths-feet-techraptor-interview-on-midnight-eclipse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 hover:text-white underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\">Ver en Wowhead <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]\"></i></a></div><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3\">In an interview with TechRaptor, Blizzard discussed Xal'atath's feet and the new player experience.<p>TechRaptor Interview</p>\n<p>TechRaptor interviewed:</p>\n<p>Paul Kubit (Associate Game Director)</p>\n<p>Kim Flack (Senior Game Designer)</p>\n<p>We've summarized the interview below, but you can see the original pieces on TechRaptor.</p>\n<p>Interview Summary</p>\n<p>Xal'atath</p>\n<p>Players noticed that Xal'atath got into a heavily guarded place easily. This wasn't an \"oversight on the Titans,\" and there are missing pieces of the story.</p>\n<p>The body that Xal'atath possesses loves to float, and that's why you typically get an angle of her feet. In addition, based on the way the community and cinematic team react to a shot, they might add another shot. </p>\n<p>They want to make sure to pay attention to the community.</p>\n<p>She has brought a much darker tone to WoW, as Midnight was always going to be the dark middle chapter of the Worldsoul Saga.</p>\n<p>Paladins</p>\n<p>They decided to add three new races to become Paladins in Patch 12.2, as it ties into the story.</p>\n<p>The Light and Void are two sides of the same coin.</p>\n<p>There will be quests that give some background on how the races could become Paladins.</p>\n<p>New Player Experience</p>\n<p>There is too much story across too many expansions to teach to a new player.</p>\n<p>The approach for Midnight is that you play through Exile's Reach and then Dragonflight.</p>\n<p>Dragonflight gives you everything you need in WoW and explains what you need to do. Older expansions don't have that.</p>\n<p>They plan to improve the War Within recap.<br></p>\n</div></div>"
      },
