      "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
      "title": {
        "en": "Fixed Count Issues in Ruby Life Pools - Patch 12.1 Midnight Hotfixes",
        "es": "Fixed Count Issues in Ruby Life Pools - Patch 12.1 Midnight Correcciones en Vivo"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes fixing issues with mobs giving count in Ruby Life Pools.Continue reading »...",
        "es": "Blizzard has posted Correcciones en Vivo for today, which includes fixing issues with mobs giving count in Ruby Life Pools.Continue reading »..."
      },
      "content": {
        "en": "<div class=\"space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/30 shadow-lg max-h-[340px] bg-black/50 mb-3\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55363-fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes.jpg\" alt=\"Fixed Count Issues in Ruby Life Pools - Patch 12.1 Midnight Hotfixes\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[340px] rounded-xl hover:scale-[1.01] transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><div class=\"bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-500/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-300 font-bold\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-newspaper mr-1.5\"></i> Wowhead Official Article</span><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news=382983/fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 hover:text-white underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\">View on Wowhead <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]\"></i></a></div><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes fixing issues with mobs giving count in Ruby Life Pools. <p>Ghosts can no longer target tanks on Mythic Coiled Altar </p>\n<p>Mobs in Ruby Life Pools will now always give count.</p>\n<p>Font of Venomous Rage has been nerfed in PvP</p>\n<p>Inflation for PvP Rating has been increased.</p>\n<p>Hotfixes<br>September 17, 2026</p>\n<p>Dungeons and Raids</p>\n<p>Ruby Life Pools</p>\n<p> Addressed an issue where Blazebound Destroyers or Primalist Flamedancers could fail to contribute towards enemy forces if no player was on their threat table when they finished their death sequence.</p>\n<p> Developers’ notes: A known side-effect of this change is that these creatures will no longer display their contribution towards enemy forces on their tooltip in the default UI.</p>\n<p>The Venomous Abyss</p>\n<p>The Coiled Altar</p>\n<p> Fixed an issue where Unnerving Fixation was targeting tanks more often than intended.</p>\n<p>Player versus Player</p>\n<p>Significantly increased PvP rating inflation for all rated PvP modes with emphasis on Battleground Blitz, Rated Battlegrounds, and Rated 3v3 Arena.</p>\n<p> Developers’ notes: We’ve seen your feedback that achievable PvP ratings are not meeting expectations, so we’re applying a significant increase to PvP rating inflation starting now for all rated PvP modes with emphasis on Battleground Blitz, Rated Battlegrounds, and Rated 3v3 Arena. As with past changes to inflation, this adjustment is intended to improve progression as the season continues and support healthier ladder movement. We’ll continue monitoring rating distribution and make further adjustments as necessary. Thank you for your continued feedback and we’ll see you on the battlefield!</p>\n<p> Font of Venomous Rage trinket damage reduced by 50% in PvP combat.<br></p>\n</div></div>",
        "es": "<div class=\"space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-slate-300\"><div class=\"rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-amber-500/30 shadow-lg max-h-[340px] bg-black/50 mb-3\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55363-fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes.jpg\" alt=\"Fixed Count Issues in Ruby Life Pools - Patch 12.1 Midnight Hotfixes\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover max-h-[340px] rounded-xl hover:scale-[1.01] transition duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><div class=\"bg-amber-950/30 border border-amber-500/40 p-3.5 rounded-xl text-xs flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-amber-300 font-bold\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-newspaper mr-1.5\"></i> Artículo Oficial de Wowhead</span><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news=382983/fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-xs text-amber-400 hover:text-white underline font-semibold flex items-center gap-1\">Ver en Wowhead <i class=\"fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]\"></i></a></div><div class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm space-y-3\">Blizzard has posted hotfixes for today, which includes fixing issues with mobs giving count in Ruby Life Pools. <p>Ghosts can no longer target tanks on Mythic Coiled Altar </p>\n<p>Mobs in Ruby Life Pools will now always give count.</p>\n<p>Font of Venomous Rage has been nerfed in PvP</p>\n<p>Inflation for PvP Rating has been increased.</p>\n<p>Hotfixes<br>September 17, 2026</p>\n<p>Dungeons and Raids</p>\n<p>Ruby Life Pools</p>\n<p> Addressed an issue where Blazebound Destroyers or Primalist Flamedancers could fail to contribute towards enemy forces if no player was on their threat table when they finished their death sequence.</p>\n<p> Developers’ notes: A known side-effect of this change is that these creatures will no longer display their contribution towards enemy forces on their tooltip in the default UI.</p>\n<p>The Venomous Abyss</p>\n<p>The Coiled Altar</p>\n<p> Fixed an issue where Unnerving Fixation was targeting tanks more often than intended.</p>\n<p>Player versus Player</p>\n<p>Significantly increased PvP rating inflation for all rated PvP modes with emphasis on Battleground Blitz, Rated Battlegrounds, and Rated 3v3 Arena.</p>\n<p> Developers’ notes: We’ve seen your feedback that achievable PvP ratings are not meeting expectations, so we’re applying a significant increase to PvP rating inflation starting now for all rated PvP modes with emphasis on Battleground Blitz, Rated Battlegrounds, and Rated 3v3 Arena. As with past changes to inflation, this adjustment is intended to improve progression as the season continues and support healthier ladder movement. We’ll continue monitoring rating distribution and make further adjustments as necessary. Thank you for your continued feedback and we’ll see you on the battlefield!</p>\n<p> Font of Venomous Rage trinket daño reducido un 50% in PvP combat.<br></p>\n</div></div>"
      },
      "originalUrl": "https://www.wowhead.com/news=382983/fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes",
      "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55363-fixed-count-issues-in-ruby-life-pools-patch-12-1-midnight-hotfixes.jpg"
